    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it isn't about \"healing\" or \"small steps\". i mean, you don't fix a house after the foundation has completely crumbled and the walls are gone. you just... you just stop. it feels like everyone is just waiting for me to \"get better\" but there's nothing left to work with. i'm just empty. it's like i've reached the end of the road and there's no road left. doesn dee some things are just to be over? like,",
